Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, Alex congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚历克丝 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:03.64,EN,,0,0,0,,through to the semifinal here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,闯进了这里的半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:04.84,EN,,0,0,0,,The crazy Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:04.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:05.80,EN,,0,0,0,,round of applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,掌声送给她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:15.80,EN,,0,0,0,,The crazy thing is the last semi-final you made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:15.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,离谱的是 你上一次打进半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.80,EN,,0,0,0,,was not that long ago in Berlin and you beat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,也没过多久 就在柏林
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.84,EN,,0,0,0,,your same opponent the same score line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手一样 比分也一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:23.32,EN,,0,0,0,,What I know it's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道 这太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:25.24,EN,,0,0,0,,What is it about playing Elina
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟斯维托丽娜交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:26.44,EN,,0,0,0,,that brings out the best in you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,为什么总能让你打出最好的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:29.00,EN,,0,0,0,,as such a great player that you have to beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,她可是你必须战胜的强手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't think that it's specifically
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不觉得有什么特别的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.60,EN,,0,0,0,,because of who I'm up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,不在于对手是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:36.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I think uh I came in with a great mindset today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:36.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想是我今天上场时心态很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:38.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I was playing really well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己打得确实不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:40.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and of course Elina hit some good shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:40.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然斯维托丽娜也打出了好球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:42.76,EN,,0,0,0,,She was being aggressive,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:42.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,她很有攻击性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:44.28,EN,,0,0,0,,especially in that second set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:46.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm really happy that I was able to kind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我很高兴自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:48.20,EN,,0,0,0,,of keep my rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,大体保持住了节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:50.44,EN,,0,0,0,,What you are learning along the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一路你学到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:52.84,EN,,0,0,0,,This is really your first full year on tour
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,今年才是你真正完整的巡回赛年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:55.96,EN,,0,0,0,,after last year, but what is it that you're learning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:55.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,那你学到的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:00:57.80,EN,,0,0,0,,about yourselves in these moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:00:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这些时刻 关于你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:01.00,EN,,0,0,0,,in these types of matches, in this atmosphere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:01.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这样的比赛 这样的气氛下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's so many things
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我学到的东西太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:05.24,EN,,0,0,0,,that I've learned about the tour, about myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:05.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,关于巡回赛 关于我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:09.16,EN,,0,0,0,,about kind of what it takes to sustain this level,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,关于维持这个水平需要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:11.32,EN,,0,0,0,,both physically and mentally,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体上和心理上都是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:14.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and just the effort you need to have to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:14.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有你必须付出的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.28,0:01:16.52,EN,,0,0,0,,hang with these top players and stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.28,0:01:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能跟顶尖球员周旋并站得住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:19.00,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's definitely a long process.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:19.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,这肯定是个漫长的过程
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:20.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not I'm just at the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:20.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不是 我才刚刚开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:22.12,EN,,0,0,0,,of that learning process.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,还在这个学习过程的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:24.76,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm really excited for what's ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我对接下来非常期待
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.76,0:01:33.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Now, I know your next opponent, Naomi Osaka,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.76,0:01:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的下一个对手是大坂直美
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:36.20,EN,,0,0,0,,which is going to be an amazing match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一定会是一场精彩的对决
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:38.28,EN,,0,0,0,,between the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:38.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在你们两人之间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:40.20,EN,,0,0,0,,You're all very excited about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:40.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家都很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.12,EN,,0,0,0,,What are your thoughts about playing Naomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟大坂直美交手你怎么看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:44.76,EN,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure you've grown up also watching her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:44.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想你也是看着她长大的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:47.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, she is of course such an accomplished player
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 她当然是非常有成就的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:50.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think she's made waves on and off
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:50.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得她在球场内外
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:53.16,EN,,0,0,0,,the tennis court uh for so many reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:53.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,都掀起过波澜 原因有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.16,0:01:55.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh there's so much respect
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.16,0:01:55.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我对她有太多敬意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.56,0:01:58.12,EN,,0,0,0,,for her for that and you know I'm really excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.56,0:01:58.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,就为这个 而且我真的很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:02:01.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I haven't had much time to think about it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:02:01.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还没什么时间去想这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:02.92,EN,,0,0,0,,but I will definitely think about it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我肯定会好好想想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.12,EN,,0,0,0,,after I get off court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,等我下场之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:06.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well, I'm going to give you one more chance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:06.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 我再给你一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:09.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to thank all your Filipino fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,去谢谢你的菲律宾球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.16,0:02:12.52,EN,,0,0,0,,They're in the crowd here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.16,0:02:12.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们就在现场看台上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:17.84,EN,,0,0,0,,So, whatever you want to say, the mic is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,想说什么都可以 话筒交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.08,0:02:23.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, through the semifinals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.08,0:02:23.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 她闯进了半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:24.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Alexandra Eala
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:24.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,伊埃拉
